    "sections": {
        "description": "A bold, contemporary full-site-editing block theme built for modern blogs and online magazines. Postfolio Blocks ships with three switchable homepage layouts (Home 1, Home 2, Home 3), a complete set of front-end templates — single post, blog index, category archive, author profile, search, and 404 — and a library of card-grid, split-hero, and spotlight block patterns composed entirely from core WordPress blocks, so every layout keeps the punchy, editorial post-grid look of popular post-listing plugins without requiring any of them to be installed. Deep color, spacing, and typography controls are exposed through the Styles panel via theme.json, and three ready-made style variations let you re-skin the whole site in one click."
    },
